    flagDescription="Blue field charged with a golden-yellow silhouette map of Kosovo in the center, surmounted by an arc of six white five-pointed stars representing Kosovo's six major ethnic communities: Albanians, Serbs, Bosniaks, Turks, Romani, and Gorani.",
