    travelNotes="Sip Europe's best macchiato at a sidewalk café in lively Pristina; climb to the medieval hilltop fortress of Prizren for panoramic views of Ottoman minarets and church towers; hike the dramatic peaks and Via Ferrata of Rugova Canyon; taste freshly baked crispy flija layered over hot coals.",
    shortSummary="Kosovo is Europe's youngest nation, brimming with vibrant café life and entrepreneurial energy, where Ottoman mosques in Prizren, medieval UNESCO monasteries, and the dramatic peaks of the Accursed Mountains meet global pop icons like Dua Lipa and Olympic gold medal judoka."
